<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Emerging growth company <span style="font-family: Segoe UI Emoji,sans-serif"><span id="xdx_90F_edei--EntityEmergingGrowthCompany_c20260601__20260601_zelFPsikkwud"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2026-06-01" format="ixt:booleanfalse" id="Fact000028" name="dei:EntityEmergingGrowthCompany">&#9744;</ix:nonNumeric></span></span></p>

